# Per-test plusargs for irq_during_rte.
#
# This test exercises audit bug #3 — an IRQ that fires during an
# in-flight RTE pop sequence (between take_rte and take_rte_finalize)
# would preempt the inject µops because arch_sr.I is still the
# pre-RTE supervisor level (so ipl_above_mask is still true).  The
# fix in exception.v + commit.v gates take_irq on `!inject_active`.
#
# Without IPL injection the test passes by-construction (HANDLER_SR
# stays 0, branches to _no_irq_yet → _pass).  With +ipl=260:1 the
# IRQ fires at the boundary right after the synthetic RTE returns to
# _target — exercising both the inject_active gate (during the RTE
# pop itself) and the rob_is_store/store-drain gate (the TARGET_HIT
# store must drain through commit_store_en before the IRQ takes).
+ipl=260:1
